/certs
*.pem
# Test fixture certs (no secret material) are committed.
!tests/fixtures/*.pem
# Codex writes its MCP server config here, and an MCP database server is
# configured with a connection string — i.e. a live password, in plaintext, in a
# file at the repo root. It was untracked but not ignored, which is one
# `git add -A` away from committed. Ignored so it cannot be.
.codex/

